@page "/changelog"
@layout PublicLayout

<PageTitle>Changelog — Muster</PageTitle>

<div class="panel glass">
    <h1>Changelog</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">User-visible changes. Internal refactors and infrastructure work aren't listed here.</p>

    <section class="changelog">

        <article>
            <header>
                <h2>v0.5 <span class="subtitle">— Pre-release</span></h2>
            </header>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Role split.</strong> Quest Manager, Economy Manager, Event Officer, Tracking
                    Manager, and Auditor join Admin and the legacy Officer umbrella. Map any Discord role to
                    the staff tier that fits — least-privilege without giving away Admin.</li>
                <li><strong>Audit log.</strong> Every staff action, every economy movement, every config
                    change is captured and searchable from the web admin. Default retention 90 days.</li>
                <li><strong>Public API hardening.</strong> Per-key rate limit, request body cap, span
                    enrichment for incident triage, and tighter authorization (personal data is self-or-staff,
                    audit-tier reads gate on Auditor).</li>
                <li><strong>Live session view.</strong> Browser-based monitoring of active tracking sessions,
                    with per-member opt-out and presence event audit.</li>
                <li><strong>Quest detail privacy.</strong> Dispute reasons and per-row review notes are now
                    only visible to the parties involved (worker, owner, manager) — not to every guild member.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article>
            <header>
                <h2>v0.4 <span class="subtitle">— Quests + Economy</span></h2>
            </header>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Quest board.</strong> Guild quests and player bounties unified on one board.
                    Difficulty tiers, deadlines, intake review, dispute arbitration, multi-slot capacity.</li>
                <li><strong>Multi-currency wallets.</strong> Seasonal Points (leaderboard) and persistent
                    spendable currencies (e.g. Coin) on one ledger.</li>
                <li><strong>External economy hooks.</strong> Per-currency outbound connector + per-guild
                    movement webhooks for integrating with loot or perk systems.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

        <article>
            <header>
                <h2>v0.3 <span class="subtitle">— Tracking foundation</span></h2>
            </header>
            <ul>
                <li><strong>Bounded sessions + background tracking.</strong> Two complementary modes for
                    rewarding voice attendance with anti-AFK guards.</li>
                <li><strong>Reaction musters.</strong> One-tap check-ins with capacity caps.</li>
                <li><strong>Seasons.</strong> Bounded scoring windows with archive on close.</li>
            </ul>
        </article>

    </section>

    <p class="subtitle">
        Detailed release notes land on <a href="/support">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
</div>
